I made the following updates today:

On the notify page:

There's a pair of options at the top "ungrouped" and "group by prefix".  Note that a performer who has events on the grid in different categories will be listed in each category.

There's a toggle that can filter to just unconfirmed performers.

There a link to set the nag text for future emails.  The nag text is saved in the database, so it will stick around after logout/login.

On the requests summary page:

It now shows the performer name and event title.  It also omits empty requests (like P_notes = "").

I don't have any other changes planned right now.  Let me know if you need something else.

The only open question I know about is the partial cancellation.  I'll think about that now and let you know.  Remind me if there's anything else outstanding.




